# Backend quality

## Stack policy
- Keep working PHP site + Tourvisor + CRM + payment paths
- Do **not** propose full rewrite (Nest/Go/etc.) unless explicitly requested
- New endpoints: clear contract, validation, typed errors, auth checks, logging

## API hygiene
- Validate all inputs at boundary
- Never trust client for price/total/bonus math — server is source of truth
- Idempotent payment / booking where possible
- No Tourvisor tokens or secrets in mobile; use backend proxy
- Prefer explicit error codes the app can map to Russian UX copy

## When changing backend
- List affected app screens
- Preserve guest vs authenticated behavior
- Document breaking changes before shipping OTA/store
